  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you fails a saving throw, you can make it take 1d10 Necrotic damage; if you do, you regain Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-DZqHb8UTSgcFZOXS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Heal yourself by the damage dealt.</p></section>",
